# GraphAum

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphAum } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphAum
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={56}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphAum
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={56}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Caption drawn on the top edge as `[ TITLE ]`. Uppercase, 1–2 words. |
| `animated?` | `boolean` | `true` | Animate the ink-in and resonance. Default true. Reduced motion freezes a settled frame. |
| `cols?` | `number` | `56` | Width of the scene in characters; at least 46 so the figure fits. Default 56. |
| `rows?` | `number` | `22` | Height of the scene in rows. Default 22. |
| `speedMs?` | `number` | `110` | Milliseconds per tick. Default 110. |
| `seedNum?` | `number` | `7` | Seed offsets the resonance wave along the stroke. Default 7. |
| `label?` | `string` | `'the primordial vibration'` | Short caption under the art; the art itself is decorative. |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphAumProps`

## Reduced motion

Animation is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
